# Normalize line endings deterministically, independent of core.autocrlf.
# Godot text resources and GDScript are LF; Windows batch files MUST be CRLF
# (cmd mis-parses goto / parenthesised blocks in LF-only .bat files).

* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.res binary
*.scn binary
